# Claude Code
#
# CLAUDE.md is ignored by pattern because `next dev` writes one per app
# (apps/web/CLAUDE.md) from generate-agent-files.js. The repository's own
# CLAUDE.md files are tracked already, and a tracked file ignores this.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/

